## AUTHENTICATION

### API Tokens (PREFERRED — fine-grained, revocable)
  Header: Authorization: Bearer {{CF_API_TOKEN}}

  Created at: Cloudflare Dashboard → My Profile → API Tokens → Create Token
  Tokens can be scoped to specific accounts, zones, and resource types.
  Prefer tokens over Global API Key for all automation.

### Global API Key (legacy — avoid)
  Headers:
    X-Auth-Email: {{CF_EMAIL}}
    X-Auth-Key: {{CF_GLOBAL_API_KEY}}
  Less secure — full account access, cannot be scoped. Use only if token is unavailable.

### Standard request pattern
  curl -s \
    -H "Authorization: Bearer {{CF_API_TOKEN}}" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/<path>

